  "ruleText": "Lot 8002.15 “Patrol judge” means the race official who observes progress of race from various vantage points around the track, and looks for any incidents that occur during the running of the race.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Lot 8000) #12544, eff 6-1-18",
